      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds interesting. i've been hearing a lot of people arguing about zoning lately though. like, is it better to push for more high-density housing to fix the housing crisis, or should cities stick to protecting single-family neighborhoods so the community character doesn't change? what's the consensus on that?",
